# 🧠 Personal Planner Web App

A simple yet effective personal productivity tool designed to help users manage tasks, stay focused, and maintain motivation — all in one place.

This project combines essential productivity features like a **To-Do List**, **Pomodoro Timer**, and **Goal Planning** with a clean **neumorphic UI** and responsive design.

---

## 🚀 Features

### ✅ To-Do List

* Add, manage, and delete tasks بسهولة
* Smooth slide animations when tasks are added
* Tasks are stored using browser cookies (local persistence)
* Data remains even after closing the browser

---

### ⏳ Pomodoro Timer

* Built-in **25-minute work + 5-minute break** cycle
* Audio alert when timer ends
* Helps improve focus and time management

---

### 💬 Motivation Section

* Displays motivational quotes
* “Change” button to refresh motivation instantly
* Keeps users mentally engaged while working

---

### 🎯 Goals Section

* Add and manage personal goals
* Assign priority/importance levels to goals
* Goals are automatically organized based on priority

---

### 📱 Responsive Design

* Works seamlessly across:

  * Mobile 📱
  * Tablet 📲
  * Desktop 💻

---

## 🎨 UI/UX Design

* Designed using **Neumorphism style**
* Clean, minimal, and distraction-free interface
* Focus on usability over heavy animations
* Subtle transitions for better user experience

---

## 🧠 Learning & Development

This project was inspired by **Cohort 2.0**, but extended with custom features such as:

* Task animations
* Dynamic motivation system
* Goal prioritization system
* Enhanced Pomodoro experience

---

## 🤖 Use of AI

AI was used as a support tool during development:

* Debugging complex issues
* Improving UI/UX decisions
* Structuring variables and logic

All core implementation and customization were done manually.

---

## 💾 Data Storage

* Uses **browser cookies** for storing user data
* No backend required
* Data persists locally for each user session

---

